'''Grotesque Gallery''' (変覧会の絵 ''Henrankai no E'', '''Weird Painting Exhibition''') is the 42nd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Apart from [[Atrocious Deco]] which requires a proper fight, most other stages use gimmicks, meaning they are very easy with the right strategy, but near-impossible otherwise.

These stages are infamous for pranking a lot of those who play this subchapter without knowledge of their mechanics. So research these stages, or play with extreme caution.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
Although not his first appearance in-game, [[Angel Fanboy]] makes his first and only appearance in Stories of Legend here.

